WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.820
We were born into a world of war.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.000
Between the monsters who destroyed our cities

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.320
and the monsters we created to stop them.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:36.120
We thought we had sacrificed enough.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.400
But the war we thought we finished.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.140
Is just beginning.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.040
And the only thing standing in front of the Apocalypse

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.720
is us.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.800
It doesn't matter where you came from

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.840
who believed in you and who didn't

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.080
this is our time, this is our chance to make a difference

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.520
now, let's get it done!

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.820
That's what I'm talking about!

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:24.780
They evolve

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.280
and then will wipe out all life

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.540
Think I could get used to this.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.780
There's something you need to see.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.780
Well ..  he's pretty big.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:04.960
Fire everything you've got!

